Constraint Violation in SPARQLConstraintComponent (http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#SPARQLConstraintComponent):
	Severity: sh:Violation
	Source Shape: oe:CrossHolonConsistencyShape
	Focus Node: oeevt:ev2041_0
	Value Node: Literal("effective")
	Result Path: oe:effectiveness
	Source Constraint: [ sh:message Literal("T5 cross-holon: contradictory effectiveness for the same drug-disease across holons.") ; sh:prefixes oe:_prefixes ; sh:select Literal("
            SELECT $this (oe:effectiveness AS ?path) (?eff1 AS ?value)
            WHERE {
                $this rdf:reifies ?tt1 .
                ?tt1 rdf:subject ?drug ; rdf:predicate oe:treats ; rdf:object ?disease .
                $this oe:effectiveness ?eff1 .
                $this holon:inHolon ?h1 .

                ?other rdf:reifies ?tt2 .
                ?tt2 rdf:subject ?drug ; rdf:predicate oe:treats ; rdf:object ?disease .
                ?other oe:effectiveness ?eff2 .
                ?other holon:inHolon ?h2 .

                FILTER (?h1 != ?h2 && ?eff1 = "effective" && ?eff2 = "ineffective")
            }
        ") ; sh:severity sh:Violation ]
	Message: T5 cross-holon: contradictory effectiveness for the same drug-disease across holons.
